  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the artistry at Lock Stock & Barrel Tattoos, where every inked creation is a unique masterpiece centered around illustrative, geometric, and floral designs. Discover Columbus's home of contemporary tattooing, a haven for skin canvases guided by the distinct styles of renowned resident artists @darkspectretattoos, @dnklp, @longandstupid, and @viccarol_tattoos_. Step into an environment where precision meets creativity, giving life to your ink dreams in the heart of the United States.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Columbus, Ohio, United States",
